{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:99595","published":"2026-11-12T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-16T18:00:24.744765262Z","related":["CVE-2026-78367","CVE-2026-84233","CVE-2026-84837","CVE-2026-84838"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-78367","CVE-2026-84233","CVE-2026-84837","CVE-2026-84838"],"summary":"Moderate: rpm security update","details":"The RPM Package Manager (RPM) is a command-line driven package management system capable of installing, uninstalling, verifying, querying, and updating software packages.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * rpm: Command injection in rpmuncompress via unescaped filenames passed to popen() (CVE-2026-84838)\n  * rpm: Command Injection in `rpmbuild -t*` (`getTarSpec`) via Unescaped Tarball Path (CVE-2026-84837)\n  * rpm: Command Execution via Macro Expansion in `rpmuncompress -x` for Crafted `.gem` Filenames (CVE-2026-84233)\n  * rpm: rpmbuild getTarSpec() crafted tar member name ? macro injection (CVE-2026-78367)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"python3-rpm","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/python3-rpm"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.19.1.1-29.el10_3.alma.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:99595.json"}},{"package":{"name":"rpm","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/rpm"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.19.1.1-29.el10_3.alma.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:99595.json"}},{"package":{"name":"rpm-apidocs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/rpm-apidocs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.19.1.1-29.el10_3